  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Blood sphere; Brew Potion or the Alchemy sphere (formulae) package.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You are able to create potions (or formulae from the Alchemy sphere) within your own blood. They can only target you, but you may activate one as a swift action, or 2 + 1 per 7 character levels as a standard action. This is a mental action that does not provoke attacks of opportunity.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/blood#toc61\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
